  "description": "Stay Strong's Optimum TRL is from their Expert level range of freestyle bikes. The TRL model is built predominantly for riding Trails, Dirt jumps and pump tracks, with it's frame geometry and parts keeping the bike feeling stable whilst in the air without sacrificing responsiveness. Paired with 2.25 trail tyres for extra grip, 30/10 gearing for better acceleration & Chain Stay mounted brakes for a stronger & more responsive brake setup! Other features include, Chromoly Top & Down tube, Tapered fork legs with Chromoly steer tube, Fully sealed bearings throughout & double wall rims makes this bike one of the best equipped complete Trail specific bikes! ###section### Product Specs FRAME MATERIAL: Chromoly Top tube & Down tube WHEEL SIZE: 20\" TOP TUBE LENGTH: 21\" CHAIN STAY LENGTH: 13.75\" HEADTUBE ANGLE: 74.5° SEAT TUBE ANGLE: 71° FORKS: Chromoly Steerer Tube and Tapered Hi-Ten Legs BARS: - MATERIAL: - TYPE: 2-Piece - RISE: - WIDTH: STEM: Alloy Top Load HEADSET: Integrated BRAKE MOUNTS: Welded U-Brake BRAKES: U-Brake FRONT HUB: 10mm Sealed FRONT RIM: Single Wall REAR HUB: 14mm Sealed Cassette REAR RIM: Double Wall TYRES: 2.25\" SPROCKET: 30t CRANKS: - MATERIAL: Chromoly - TYPE: 3-Piece - ARM LENGTH: 170mm BB: 19mm Mid PEDALS: Nylon/Fiberglass SEAT: Combo Seat/Post GEARING: 30/10 WEIGHT: 24.91lbs (11.3kg) ###section### Product Highlights Great for riders who are between 5ft and 6ft tall (150cm - 180cm) Designed with more stable feeling geometry to suit trails and park riding Built strong and lightweight Sealed rear hub Includes sealed bearings ###shogun-image-section###",
